ount":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oCbJpGl8IkH1WdYa25TDBA","review_id":"OEHHU_XmKhM3JOHpa13G1A","date":"2019-05-09T15:11:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9471133351325989,"text_excerpt":"Saw this place on Instagram one day and the food looked really good. I was already down in New Orleans this particular afternoon so we decided to give it a try. Notice, the parking sucks. And I mean sucks. We went for an early dinner and still had an issue trying to find parking. Park next to the subway and pray you'll be able to get out. The inside is a little cozy place not big enough for huge parties but enough room to sort of move around for a few guest. We were seated and greeted promptly by the hostess. Our server brought us our waters while we looked through the menu. I also got here during happy hour and they have 50% alcohol during this time. Basically 2 for 1 drinks which was gr..."},{"business_id":"oCbJpGl8IkH1WdYa25TDBA","review_id":"fOpdPefLTx2xiWyRpkxgww","date":"2018-09-27T20:54:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9441997408866882,"text_excerpt":"Boyfriend and I went there for his birthday lunch. I'd heard amazing things about this place and wanted to try it out. It's located on St Claude Ave so being a native I'm aware of the parking challenges so no worries there. We had the charbroiled oysters as an appetizer. I had the Redfish Acadiana and he tried the butterflied grilled chicken. He had baked macaroni and red beans and rice as sides while I had the garlic potatoes. We were not disappointed. The food was hot, flavored and absolutely delicious. Our waiter was attentive and patient while we searched through the menu like the newbies we were. While the place is small we did not experience any wait to be seated. I also know when t..."},{"business_id":"oCbJpGl8IkH1WdYa25TDBA","review_id":"KHh08VE6JfUnUvHO0GaOkA","date":"2019-06-17T23:00:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9375907182693481,"text_excerpt":"This was my second time at Morrows, and I'd give 5/5 both times! Our waitress was very nice and accommodating, especially when I asked if my pasta could come with the white wine sauce (that I had previously with the Ocean's Delight pasta) instead of the cream based sauce that the dish comes with. I also had the crabmeat topped charbroiled oysters..they were excellent! The oysters were huge and they didn't skimp on the crabmeat. The place is not very large and the demand is high, so I'd suggest going at non-high traffic hours (it even gets super packed on weekdays...you'll be waiting outside during busy hours). But, I'd definitely say that everyone in NOLA should go and experience, and I'd..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oCbJpGl8IkH1WdYa25TDBA","photo_id":"f2k80Lb4l6lhmDMwh35qqw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/f2k80Lb4l6lhmDMwh35qqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8922601938247681},{"business_id":"oCbJpGl8IkH1WdYa25TDBA","photo_id"